  "title": "wiretap: BER: Prevent overflow",
  "description": "If overflow occurs, it almost surely caused the length check to fail and\nthe file to be rejected, so it was mostly harmless, but did prevent\nfiles of single BER objects larger than 4GiB(?!) from being opened.\n\nTested to work with some extract certs that are larger than 127 bytes\nand so use length bytes.\n\nFix #16465\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
